Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.77,0:00:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,新银河接近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是属于处女座里的星球之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有智慧的生命体吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的话他的智慧程度是？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么画像寻找开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河周围发现 高速行进中的不明物体
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,画像扩大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:00:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,画像扩大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:00:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没见过这样的宇宙船呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是落伍的交通工具吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像还不够文明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.59,0:01:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 下一个猎物就是那个银河
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.73,0:01:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先先登陆不起眼的无人星 看看状况吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么进入超时空飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！知道神秘列车吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的地有可能是九州、四国 或北海道很神秘的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿有各种有趣的活动 在等着你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,想参加的人实在太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,车票虽然很难买
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有3张
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！另外两个让谁去好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大雄一定也很想去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香，别管大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！你看说曹操曹操就到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 神秘列车的车票已没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有看到哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经三天没回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来不会不打声招呼 就出门的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会被车撞到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是被坏人带走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.93,0:02:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别这么不负责任的乱说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的好担心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一如果他发生了什么事的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦不可能发生什么事情的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家的狗“利娜” 也是一星期后跑回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能掉到哪儿去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.75,0:02:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，可以贴悬赏海报呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,问保健所可能比较快唷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是猫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:14.06,Title,0,0,0,0,,《大雄与银河超特急》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.85,0:04:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦在找你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄先把晚饭吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.39,0:04:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么晚了你去哪儿啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我要问你的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了一下22世纪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了一样好东西喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？是什么好东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是现在最有人气的22世纪 银河超特急的车票
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,22世纪银河超特急的车票？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊！排了3天才拿到手的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 明天晚上出发的车票
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车是银河超特急的神秘列车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从银河的中心出发
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知道目的地是哪里喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这样才会有期待感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很想邀请你们去的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是好像行程有点重复的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空旅行好像很好玩耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊 早知道就不要做无聊的约定了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样呢 一点也不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙是很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,又黑又暗也没有空气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞不好会被宇宙人抓去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定也会被流星撞到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,与其这样在地面上走 还是绝对安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止还没有听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河超特急有发生过任何事情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到宇宙船也只不过像 游览船一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在以前是重要的大众交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为发明了任意门
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才被利用为 观光的交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证绝对安全
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是这样的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样花几天的时间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.94,0:06:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不是很伤脑的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为银河是很宽广的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.91,0:06:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你大可不用担心这些
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论去哪里都可用任意门回家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以白天去学校 晚上就去宇宙旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如何呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好期待喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜晚怎么不赶快来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到银河底端了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先寻找没有住生物的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个星球只有岩石 没有多细胞生物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 马上设立基地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.85,0:07:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙膏、牙刷、毛巾、零食和漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要带那些东西的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了关灯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗户也关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，不要被妈妈发现
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,车站在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会到后山来等我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的会来这里接我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，刚好晚上12点的时候到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空中铁道是很准确的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏跳得好快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 兴奋的说不出话来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好像在作梦喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 别睡着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的在空中行走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 很帅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快坐上去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是7号车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里，晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您好 - 您好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，这什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面比从外面看起来要大得多
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是特别空间有5间单人房
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有会议室
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面设施都能用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,车长 从地球上车的有2个喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.57,0:09:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像没人在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 要开车了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,车长、司机都不在 但列车在移动着耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看地球变成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.97,0:10:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.87,0:10:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没跟他们打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.87,0:10:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是有买车票的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香他们若来了就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有5间房间嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道就请他们也来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就今晚享受一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要哪间房间？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要1号房
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我选旁边的2号房
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么待会儿见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 里面这么宽咧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有床啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.60,0:10:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您乘坐本列车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要您喝了这瓶宇宙饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论在宇宙的任何温度环境下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,您都能舒舒服服的适应它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以在宇宙生存的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？这个按键是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.25,0:11:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 可以看见外面耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦 红色星星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是火星吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么快就不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么快就不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要去展望车厢看看？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，要去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,展望车厢在哪儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在58号车厢 所以嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,58号车厢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从外面看只有8个车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但实际上这列车有120个车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有120个车厢呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去展望车厢 就像参加运动会一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等、等一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑慢一点儿嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看窗户
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙里怎么会有忍者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是太累了吧，看到幻象了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，竹蜻蜓给你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不早点拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过在车厢里用竹蜻蜓真好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么豪华的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是展望车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么漂亮的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想给静香看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去后可以说给她听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.07,0:12:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是木星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.17,0:12:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,木星？好大唷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是太阳系里最大的惑星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球来的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我看看你们的车票
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是车长吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么到现在才出现啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为总公司叫我回去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.27,0:12:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他大约还有600位的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.07,0:13:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为旅途遥远
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在在房间里休息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是用任意门出去办事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要喝点果汁？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以送到房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,木星通过了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始时空跳跃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.27,0:13:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,会维持一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回房间去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这儿开始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,会出现特殊效果星际影像
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好困哟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好困哟 下一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,去展望车厢看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.43,0:14:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有其他的客人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小便后睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也附有浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.11,0:14:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是豪华啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看镜子里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.03,0:14:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚有人在呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再仔细看看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.57,0:14:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人都没有呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的看到了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在别的房间睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.68,0:14:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，让我和你一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他还有很多房间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人睡太可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.15,0:14:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,会睡不着的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄你有点分寸好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家啰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再让我睡一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校会迟到喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 学校
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,下课后再来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，起来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像全包下来的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又舒服，服务又好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.59,0:15:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,从展望车看出去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,木星、土星真是漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真期待今天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的旅行团是今天晚上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，请期待着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们两个都不说话呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:16:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有意见的话 说出来不就得了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定认为 早知道就应该去那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个人也可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.39,0:16:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但相反的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再认为我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,啰唆！真啰唆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他那么生气呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！我去拜托大雄看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好朋友 其实有事要麻烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，正等你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.49,0:16:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，还是先拒绝小夫再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那家伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈，我们要商讨功课的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.87,0:16:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吵我们喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.27,0:16:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么晚了还要研究功课
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.01,0:16:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.31,0:16:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们是瞒着小夫来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.55,0:17:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨！ - 哇！你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,反叛者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 揍死你 - 不要吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是银河超特急
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是列车里头？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像饭店喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去向车长付帐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,先进去房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要5号房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我4号房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我3号房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,行李放好后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去展望车厢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在会议室等你们喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一定会吓一大跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:18:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？有西部牛仔？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种家伙交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.51,0:18:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦，没有人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚明明开枪了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,用手枪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，大惊小怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的开枪了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍者、镜中人、西部牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,去展望车厢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也找另外两个人去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.07,0:18:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有立体电动耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这列车的服务真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,特意跑来这里却不去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.22,0:18:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香真替人着想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,展望车厢很远嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:18:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个车厢就是展望车厢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.27,0:19:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何？这么漂亮的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮的景色？在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,展望车厢不见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，到底是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不晓得呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？我帮他看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心，轻微脑震荡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍微让他躺一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会醒的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么突然变亮了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,新生的宇宙爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,特殊假想画像
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.41,0:19:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大银河诞生的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车进入超时空跳跃时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,会显像出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，你醒了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,展望车厢哟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是特殊想像画像
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙时代
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续了10万年
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的银河是处女座
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全搞不懂在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,回房去玩电动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想多待一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我去找哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比昨晚热闹多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦去哪了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么出现了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,海…贼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,海贼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊，刚刚看到海贼的出现
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:20:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:21:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐…恐龙出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把玻璃打破探进头了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还在也说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人在呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里的窗户被打破了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的看到了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.67,0:21:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不相信我就揍你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人说不相信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚也说 看到了西部牛仔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.35,0:21:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看到了海贼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快通知哆啦A梦去查查看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.29,0:21:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到哆啦A梦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.72,0:21:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没来这里哟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会去哪儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.40,0:21:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:21:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,详细情形到会议室再说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.81,0:22:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事 - 有事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,总公司来了一个紧急通知
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？盗贼团？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！神秘黑色影团
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着宇宙边缘的运转
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪者将无人的小惑星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当作基地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.10,0:22:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,用海贼船来到处捣乱发威
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还一直相信这是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安全的旅行团呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到房间里锁上房门
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,向上天祈祷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,亏你们还敢邀请我们来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.95,0:22:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.22,0:22:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是我拜托你们来的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回家
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，对了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.13,0:22:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用任意门回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.37,0:23:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没想到这一点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.41,0:23:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色影团若来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.41,0:23:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要车长及旅客都不在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也没办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等黑色影团通过了银河后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.35,0:23:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.38,0:23:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.42,0:23:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,门里的超空间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.82,0:23:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,被黑色影团给上锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.59,0:23:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们做的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能从这个列车逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车好像从时空跳跃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.07,0:23:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来到宇宙了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.75,0:23:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车全速前进通过小惑星群
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.38,0:23:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,会持续急转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.22,0:23:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请小心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底会变成怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.64,0:24:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.84,0:24:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不觉得 终于变得有趣了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.28,0:24:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从以前都一直冒险过来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.65,0:24:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论遇到什么都会奋战到底
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.38,0:24:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.62,0:24:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能逃，跟他们拼到底吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.29,0:24:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄每次都会忽然讲一些
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.69,0:24:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很帅气的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.76,0:24:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲得好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.33,0:24:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如果进攻过来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就拼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.50,0:24:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.93,0:24:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟坏人拼了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿透环
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.07,0:24:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和大雄到车顶察看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.31,0:24:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.58,0:24:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.21,0:24:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.15,0:24:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.45,0:24:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以竹蜻蜓是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.15,0:24:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.75,0:24:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.59,0:25:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄小心点哟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.02,0:25:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得有一样好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.99,0:25:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,止滑手套和鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.56,0:25:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这好像青蛙一样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.67,0:25:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，到前面看看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.54,0:25:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦，有人在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.08,0:25:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，车长
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.52,0:25:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人，很危险的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.99,0:25:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你在这里 列车行进没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.89,0:25:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是自动运行的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.49,0:25:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位也来乘凉的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.63,0:25:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是刚刚的…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.13,0:25:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是巴姆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.47,0:25:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是报社记者
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.27,0:25:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是猫型机器人哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.64,0:25:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,请指教
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.67,0:25:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,报社记者为何在这列车上？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.44,0:25:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不容易来度假
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.65,0:25:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,却遭遇到这种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.75,0:26:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.42,0:26:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星在发光
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.62,0:26:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里一个
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.69,0:26:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也有
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一个一个星星的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.69,0:26:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都躲着黑色影团
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相发出信号
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.13,0:26:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下就会攻过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.06,0:26:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有炮弹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.16,0:26:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是信号弹而已
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.60,0:26:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总比没有得好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.02,0:26:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.19,0:26:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是玩具呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然大雄没有其他优点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.32,0:26:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却是射击的天才哟
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.87,0:26:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.50,0:26:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其他飞船攻过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.37,0:26:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被攻击的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.84,0:26:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快想办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.98,0:27:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我，我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.06,0:27:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但无止境啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.26,0:27:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被包围了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.71,0:27:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能控制了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.31,0:27:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被那星星吸进去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.37,0:27:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怎样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.07,0:28:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.67,0:28:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫非是天国？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.07,0:28:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车好像没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.71,0:28:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚的骚动不知是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.95,0:28:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.00,0:28:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.55,0:28:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.15,0:28:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色影团在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.86,0:28:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知消失到哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.82,0:28:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.19,0:28:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,若打过来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.03,0:28:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,正打算攻回去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没干劲的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.63,0:28:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还不能掉以轻心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.10,0:28:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能马上就攻过来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.37,0:28:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.17,0:28:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.74,0:28:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道呀
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去车长那里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.58,0:28:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求警备队支援
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.68,0:28:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色影团又来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.98,0:28:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，这是烟火
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.09,0:28:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.16,0:28:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听得到音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.82,0:28:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.06,0:28:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 影像越来越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.96,0:29:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.20,0:29:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.83,0:29:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是宇宙中最大、最新 最棒的梦幻乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.87,0:29:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦幻乐园？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.74,0:29:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.78,0:29:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾听说银河外盖有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.71,0:29:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,主题乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.75,0:29:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.52,0:29:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,最开始的节目列车强盗秀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.72,0:29:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位觉得好玩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.02,0:29:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚的是秀啰？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.06,0:29:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎没察觉到呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.76,0:29:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为死了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.46,0:29:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦幻乐园为附近的小学生们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.23,0:29:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备有忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.67,0:29:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,西部星球及恐龙星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.10,0:29:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种的冒险游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.07,0:29:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是列车的实况转播
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.21,0:29:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.38,0:29:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.55,0:29:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.45,0:29:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多人呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.52,0:30:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说有600人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.26,0:30:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.03,0:30:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.89,0:30:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的打扮很有趣耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.46,0:30:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前的打扮呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.70,0:30:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是以前的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.07,0:30:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.10,0:30:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是从20世纪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.90,0:30:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？20世纪？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.34,0:30:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪穿着落伍
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.71,0:30:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是以前的人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.54,0:30:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在电视上看过的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.11,0:30:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,20世纪的人是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.35,0:30:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在洞窟里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.22,0:30:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,用石头做的穴吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.58,0:30:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会… 铁之类的东西已经在用了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.85,0:30:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙 欺负人呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.46,0:30:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.72,0:30:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.69,0:30:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要进入梦幻乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.63,0:30:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请先回列车上 先回列车上
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.43,0:31:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.70,0:31:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,比小惑星里较高等的星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.97,0:31:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然有很多生命体闯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.00,0:31:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么集团呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.64,0:31:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么目的？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.84,0:31:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让间谍去查查看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.85,0:31:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请小心
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.81,0:31:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.83,0:31:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车自动降落
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.93,0:31:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是方便呀
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.37,0:31:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.34,0:31:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去西部星球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.50,0:31:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的怪兽星球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.44,0:31:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.31,0:32:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个也蛮好玩的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.18,0:32:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,先去西部星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.91,0:32:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.68,0:32:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.18,0:32:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！去西部星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.55,0:32:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？去忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.12,0:32:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但西部星球…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.29,0:32:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫也想去忍者星球，对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.23,0:32:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.13,0:32:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 二比一
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.73,0:32:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就决定去忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.80,0:32:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也要问一下静香呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.20,0:32:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.57,0:32:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦，去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.10,0:32:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！任意门
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.71,0:32:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香有重要的事先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.48,0:32:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.34,0:32:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己喜欢去哪个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.48,0:32:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去哪个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.31,0:32:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐小飞机的话
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.95,0:32:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以自由的去绕了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.78,0:32:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎不早说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.29,0:32:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.09,0:32:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.93,0:32:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.83,0:32:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,留个话给静香
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.93,0:32:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎和小夫去忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.80,0:32:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和大雄去西部星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.47,0:32:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香也赶快来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.87,0:33:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你来哟
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.21,0:33:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.34,0:33:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里借小飞机呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.41,0:33:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这直走约2公里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.71,0:33:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？2公里？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.85,0:33:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真远啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.55,0:33:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不方便
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.15,0:33:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！古代人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.19,0:33:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在做什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.26,0:33:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油呀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.76,0:33:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不懂什么是轴承路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.96,0:33:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，对了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.70,0:33:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,轴承路
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.73,0:33:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是轴承路？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.37,0:33:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看路面
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.70,0:33:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用小圆球做的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.34,0:33:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要利用圆球上回转力的话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.84,0:33:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度就会变得很快的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.67,0:33:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.55,0:33:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,重量波推进飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.66,0:33:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有各种式样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.09,0:33:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这架如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.73,0:33:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会操纵吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.03,0:34:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这是全自动的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.60,0:34:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以操纵没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.53,0:34:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但请不要去“禁断星球”
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.97,0:34:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.10,0:34:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,导游手册也提到过
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.40,0:34:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么请慢慢享用
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.51,0:34:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,西部星球，出发
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.42,0:34:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,“禁断星球”是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.19,0:34:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前曾有人在那挖掘矿石
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.16,0:34:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是无人星球 到处都是坑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.96,0:34:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很危险的 现在禁止进入
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.31,0:34:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临枪烟城市
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.81,0:34:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是市长柯林顿.依斯.吴顿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.35,0:34:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上，今天我们要从各位中选出
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.85,0:35:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,本市的警长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.46,0:35:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在射击大会即将开始
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.93,0:35:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会选出警长的助手
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.23,0:35:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长助手是最能够享有 警长的各种名誉的人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.37,0:35:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么各位请到饭店里换衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后到会场集合 - 警长？我好想…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.38,0:35:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,射击的话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.94,0:35:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有自信的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.71,0:35:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦，古代人也来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.05,0:35:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,弓箭应比手枪更适合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.05,0:35:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.15,0:35:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.32,0:35:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何？适合我吗？很有架势吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.43,0:35:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,像西部牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.36,0:35:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,里头装有真的子弹？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.06,0:35:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.00,0:35:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面写的是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.27,0:35:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果打到坏角色的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.10,0:35:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会停在机器人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但打到人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.21,0:35:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会变得轻飘飘的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.24,0:35:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在空中浮上来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.24,0:35:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是很安全的子弹
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.94,0:35:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.81,0:35:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将成为警长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.88,0:36:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会场在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.32,0:36:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,候选人请到这儿来集合
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.82,0:36:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,标的物是这六个空瓶及空罐
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.52,0:36:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,请听我的哨声后开始射击
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.42,0:36:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,6发里面 只要中2发就合格
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.89,0:36:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一位请就位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.90,0:36:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.87,0:36:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像很强的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.30,0:36:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来就像西部的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.20,0:36:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.98,0:36:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只中1发 不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.15,0:36:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个中心没偏歪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.82,0:36:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.72,0:36:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.02,0:36:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.72,0:36:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.02,0:36:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是歪的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.29,0:36:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,中2发
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.50,0:36:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,合格
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.43,0:36:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.50,0:36:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，换我了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.67,0:36:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.20,0:36:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要全都打中喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.81,0:36:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部没打中 不合格 下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.18,0:37:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.65,0:37:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.35,0:37:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.42,0:37:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.58,0:37:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.15,0:37:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.85,0:37:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,全看你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.99,0:37:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,中5发
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.00,0:37:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前的最高者
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.46,0:37:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,合格！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.43,0:37:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小意思嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.70,0:37:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.67,0:37:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会是警长啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.07,0:37:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不及格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.44,0:37:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,合格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.21,0:37:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,中3发
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.41,0:37:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,合格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.14,0:37:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.08,0:37:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 轮到古代人了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.61,0:37:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家躲好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.75,0:37:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹会飞到哪里可不知道唷
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.02,0:37:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你们笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.29,0:37:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然很难每个都中
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.92,0:37:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是集中一个目标的话 我可是很厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.06,0:37:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只中1发
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.03,0:37:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.53,0:37:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合格 果然是古代人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.80,0:38:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,请仔细看
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.81,0:38:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个洞
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.31,0:38:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹在罐子里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.44,0:38:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,6发全中
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.05,0:38:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,合格
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.11,0:38:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.08,0:38:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.99,0:38:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在举行各位警长助手的 任命仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.69,0:38:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位维持秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.49,0:38:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,和罪犯挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.86,0:38:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让枪烟城市成为 永远和平的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.23,0:38:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,授予徽章
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.97,0:38:32.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警长）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.67,0:38:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄很适合你唷
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.74,0:38:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.97,0:38:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.41,0:38:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.21,0:38:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,会成为警长的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.75,0:38:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.81,0:38:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也好想当呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.52,0:38:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.85,0:38:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.28,0:38:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会成为警长的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.85,0:38:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来要做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.02,0:38:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在哪里 有人会发动暴动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.49,0:39:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得了，银行强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.96,0:39:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄看你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.90,0:39:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.37,0:39:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.61,0:39:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.21,0:39:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,与其开枪 跟在后面追比较快
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.14,0:39:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.05,0:39:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.31,0:39:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.25,0:39:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 违反规则
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.02,0:39:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在西部星球里使用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.05,0:39:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的客人会说话的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.42,0:39:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.33,0:39:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开，别挡路
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.23,0:39:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.16,0:39:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在那里拖拖拉拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.73,0:39:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.40,0:39:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去“OK牧场”骑马
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.73,0:39:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然它是最乖巧的…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.57,0:39:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,适合我们的只有这匹了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.44,0:39:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.54,0:39:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们赶到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.18,0:39:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.11,0:39:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这张手册
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.55,0:39:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,西部有个叫“死亡山谷”里面
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.32,0:39:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有强盗集团
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.30,0:40:00.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（死亡山谷）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.13,0:40:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.87,0:40:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,被打中了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.17,0:40:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对方有4个人 只有我一人脱逃
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.37,0:40:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有关系呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.14,0:40:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个钟头后就会落地
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.01,0:40:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好像都被打中了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.62,0:40:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.38,0:40:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在还没被打中前赶快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.19,0:40:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，敌人很接近唷
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.49,0:40:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.43,0:40:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.33,0:40:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,悄悄地靠近查看情形
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.43,0:40:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这之前被发现就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.30,0:40:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形液体
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.60,0:40:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它倒到地面就可以钻进地下了？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.47,0:40:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.61,0:40:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，分两路进行
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.35,0:40:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.25,0:41:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从窗户偷偷地看看
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.69,0:41:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 有人出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.03,0:41:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.23,0:41:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一群胆小鬼没骨气
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.63,0:41:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？怎么会有帽子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.10,0:41:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 大雄被发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.75,0:41:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.88,0:41:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是狐狸吧？真稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.28,0:41:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他腌在罐里头吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有其他同党
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.12,0:41:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他招供
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.76,0:41:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.19,0:41:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我在这
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.50,0:41:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.60,0:42:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,任命大雄是我们城市的 正义警长
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.14,0:42:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没意思
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.61,0:42:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去别的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.88,0:42:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.35,0:42:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪个星球呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.12,0:42:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这神气的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.02,0:42:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想让静香看看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.15,0:42:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有小夫跟胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.66,0:42:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍者星球不知道好不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.83,0:42:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太难啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.73,0:42:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不想来忍者星球嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.60,0:42:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啰唆，再说要掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.67,0:42:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.30,0:42:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛看着路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.64,0:42:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,修行还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.98,0:42:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓忍者就是要对死亡觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.22,0:42:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的苦都要忍受
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.99,0:42:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你教我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.69,0:42:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.29,0:42:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望能在空中飞
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.02,0:42:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是学会隐身术等 较特别的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.80,0:42:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.63,0:42:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如在学校上体育课
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.87,0:43:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的小孩真没耐性
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.67,0:43:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫，我们去别的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.07,0:43:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.37,0:43:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.04,0:43:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真拿你们没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.18,0:43:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只好传授你们临时证
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.51,0:43:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,传授临时证？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.15,0:43:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,传授你们这个临时证
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.15,0:43:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了让忍者修行成绩良好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.39,0:43:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用此卷轴能成穿墙隐形人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.16,0:43:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用这个卷轴能成穿墙隐形人？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.56,0:43:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何使用？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.53,0:43:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,里头有输入念力的电脑程式
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.57,0:43:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要含在嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.47,0:43:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,心里想着 就可以穿墙
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.14,0:43:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬墙之术 隐身之术
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.51,0:43:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且能够变成老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.11,0:43:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样而已？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.58,0:43:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,临时证就是这样而已啦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.51,0:43:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫，试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.28,0:43:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.65,0:43:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了，胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.35,0:43:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.56,0:43:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么接受测验看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.23,0:43:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过了的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.99,0:43:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,能拿到真正的证明唷
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.06,0:44:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,深入那座城去找秘密的文件
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.00,0:44:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,正式的证书可以用在 很多的法术上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.77,0:44:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.67,0:44:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的法术都输入在里头了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.64,0:44:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.54,0:44:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.84,0:44:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,期待拿到忍者证书
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.52,0:44:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.69,0:44:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有守卫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.55,0:44:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那走这边
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.73,0:44:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,用穿墙术就可轻松钻进来了 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.70,0:44:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密文件在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.68,0:44:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可疑者
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.31,0:44:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.14,0:44:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.95,0:44:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.92,0:44:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.15,0:45:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用法术真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.22,0:45:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.52,0:45:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！有写着秘书之房
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.69,0:45:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密文件应该藏在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.13,0:45:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的房间呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.57,0:45:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.33,0:45:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边放着一个什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.90,0:45:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.37,0:45:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.50,0:45:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘书之箱
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.44,0:45:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.71,0:45:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么简单就拿到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.41,0:45:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是新手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.72,0:45:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.22,0:45:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,10年后再来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.32,0:45:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.13,0:45:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜拳输了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.23,0:45:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.46,0:45:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,童话星球是少女喜欢的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.77,0:45:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是女孩子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.67,0:45:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临童话星球
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.15,0:46:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.68,0:46:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大的彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.12,0:46:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到啦，真啰唆
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.39,0:46:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西飞过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.69,0:46:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会是侯鸟呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.66,0:46:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天马，是天马群
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.80,0:46:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错耶
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.20,0:46:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.87,0:46:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.53,0:46:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.10,0:46:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公室在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.37,0:46:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在童话星球里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.77,0:46:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将成为童话中的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.34,0:46:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有各种不同的游戏 让你亲身体验
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.95,0:46:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如灰姑娘、拇指姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.85,0:46:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.12,0:46:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要参加白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.89,0:46:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.05,0:46:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,白雪公主是最受欢迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.86,0:46:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要排队等
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.06,0:46:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.96,0:46:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是狐狸秀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.26,0:46:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就可进场
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.83,0:46:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不要呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.93,0:46:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么请再等3次
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.53,0:46:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的两位客人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.83,0:46:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要当王子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.80,0:46:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.90,0:46:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.81,0:46:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.21,0:47:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先吃热狗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.84,0:47:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.61,0:47:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在等待的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.88,0:47:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果觉得无聊的话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.88,0:47:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以先到前面去见习 如何呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.63,0:47:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,童话故事的现场到了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.13,0:47:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.20,0:47:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,玻璃棺木有7具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.57,0:47:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为参加者太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.37,0:47:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以一次用7个白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.94,0:47:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时进行
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.71,0:47:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 王子来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.61,0:47:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子，请救救白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.05,0:47:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.48,0:47:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？7个白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.09,0:47:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子，伤脑筋呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.32,0:47:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.96,0:47:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.86,0:47:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.96,0:47:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在等着你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.60,0:47:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去我城堡里好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.73,0:47:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.70,0:48:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我也等好久了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.24,0:48:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.91,0:48:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎能只选一个公主
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.28,0:48:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等了5次了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.71,0:48:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.61,0:48:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你也要参加吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.15,0:48:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.69,0:48:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,童话星球是很无趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.02,0:48:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次换我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.69,0:48:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去恐龙星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.96,0:48:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去和恐龙对决
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.03,0:48:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边好像有个生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.10,0:48:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,附到其中一个人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.07,0:48:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓一个人来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.00,0:48:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭你也想当公主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.58,0:48:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 阿斯达
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.35,0:48:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？阿斯达
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.40,0:48:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间安静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.32,0:48:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯达你不要紧吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.25,0:48:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的身体呀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.59,0:48:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好久没有进入新的生命体了 - 阿斯达
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.32,0:49:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么了 - 你搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.87,0:49:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急联络
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.21,0:49:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,总司令部，我是008号
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.44,0:49:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已进入人体里成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.85,0:49:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 在小惑星里 有好几百人蠢动着
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.79,0:49:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,正等着你的指令
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.29,0:49:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是总司令部
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.62,0:49:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,008号真厉害，辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.33,0:49:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来马上进行第2个动作
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.16,0:49:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入每一个人的身体里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.83,0:49:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去习惯人体 等待指令
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.17,0:49:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了后 发动总攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.10,0:49:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后可以把整个星球占据下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.78,0:49:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被星球的武士抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.08,0:49:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们关在地下道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.35,0:50:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,用穿墙术才好不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.26,0:50:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.42,0:50:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,童话星球也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.66,0:50:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果去西部星球就好了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.50,0:50:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天一起去中世纪的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.60,0:50:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙星球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.47,0:50:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.80,0:50:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是好可怕呀 恐龙会攻击我们的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.41,0:50:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 是休闲乐园，很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.14,0:50:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么为了明天 今晚要好好睡一觉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.39,0:50:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,华丽边际的星球 是属于太阳系的小惑星
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.00,0:50:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于地方不便
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.46,0:50:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前出有矿石而曾轰动一时
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.03,0:50:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有珍贵的矿石
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.24,0:50:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但矿石挖完后
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.54,0:50:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下坑坑洞洞的小星球而已
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.15,0:50:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去工作的人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.11,0:51:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下田园到城市去了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.59,0:51:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.69,0:51:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些边际星球会消灭的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.16,0:51:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦幻乐园是我们 讨论了好几次的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.06,0:51:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.00,0:51:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才盖了梦幻乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.67,0:51:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.50,0:51:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,边际星球所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.77,0:51:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于残留的星球做的赌注
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.81,0:51:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果巴姆能把这里一流的器材
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.24,0:51:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及漂亮的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.91,0:51:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,登在新闻上 让大家知道的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.31,0:51:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，等我取材后
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.12,0:51:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会登在报纸上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.65,0:51:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先要确认的是安全性的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.85,0:51:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多乐园里 有许多的机器坏掉的毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.16,0:51:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人会发生危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.19,0:51:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是绝对不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.33,0:51:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那栋建筑物
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.53,0:51:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.23,0:51:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天24小时都会
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.00,0:51:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,守着周围的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.10,0:51:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大如恐龙星球 小如妖精
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.84,0:52:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但万一发生事故时…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.98,0:52:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那中心的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.74,0:52:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个通信灯塔 可以发出求救信号
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.65,0:52:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有什么问题 本部的警卫队就会马上赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.12,0:52:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么明天开始
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.83,0:52:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去各地探访
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.53,0:52:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请慢慢探访
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.16,0:52:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我送你 - 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.63,0:52:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.34,0:52:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，好晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.37,0:52:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？那些发光体是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.01,0:52:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是流星吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.48,0:52:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近的天空有很多星屑
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.08,0:52:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.32,0:52:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气，晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.45,0:52:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.73,0:52:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.89,0:52:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上开始行动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.56,0:52:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,个别去找一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.47,0:52:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己放进去习惯人体
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.63,0:53:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.27,0:53:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,及通讯中心的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.44,0:53:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要让机器人混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.34,0:53:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.05,0:53:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是去通信室的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.08,0:53:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,001号行动
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.00,0:53:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.00,0:53:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.17,0:53:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么，只是跌倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.10,0:53:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么交班了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.64,0:53:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果生病的话不要勉强唷
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.47,0:53:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.24,0:53:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.71,0:53:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,身分确认
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.28,0:53:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,指纹确认
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.32,0:53:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.79,0:53:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.73,0:53:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天就破坏这里的设备
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.29,0:54:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,边际星球就没得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.37,0:54:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真简单
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.33,0:54:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 部长在叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.50,0:54:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发光体掉落地面
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.17,0:54:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保安队调查
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.84,0:54:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是！马上联络
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.31,0:54:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋人类
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.11,0:54:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日到了还不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.69,0:54:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦，起来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.72,0:54:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.30,0:54:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来了 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.06,0:54:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.06,0:54:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香，好早呀 现在马上准备
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.23,0:54:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这之前有事想麻烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.77,0:54:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？要任意门 做什么用？回家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.71,0:54:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洗澡 - 啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.51,0:54:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚没法洗嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.41,0:54:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么呀，最里面的房间是浴室啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.11,0:54:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,早说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.35,0:54:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈，静香就是静香
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.59,0:55:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要出发可能还要一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.32,0:55:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.59,0:55:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快去恐龙星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.63,0:55:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.00,0:55:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.93,0:55:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发前洗澡？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.80,0:55:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在星际中洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.20,0:55:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒的露天澡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.85,0:55:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！真失礼！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.15,0:55:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梦幻乐园的机器人？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.69,0:55:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是幽浮玩具？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.89,0:55:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是色狼幽浮呀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.20,0:55:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,若说是玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.43,0:55:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得很精致啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.73,0:55:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种东西等一下再说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.93,0:55:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.87,0:55:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.07,0:55:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.81,0:55:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 巴姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.58,0:55:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.51,0:56:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要和我们一起去恐龙星球？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.82,0:56:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.15,0:56:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不到各地探访是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.82,0:56:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们慢慢玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.96,0:56:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.06,0:56:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.53,0:56:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是大冒险的开始喔
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.25,0:56:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这中生代的星球里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.08,0:56:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表着三叠纪，侏罗纪及 白亚纪时期的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.05,0:56:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,像古时候一样地生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.09,0:56:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位请自由地探险
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.66,0:56:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一天靠近自己喜欢的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.39,0:56:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们培养感情成为朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.43,0:56:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以像好朋友般乘坐自如后
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.23,0:56:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天便可参加赛龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.04,0:56:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说骑恐龙竞赛啰
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.11,0:56:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,从山脚到海边
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.61,0:56:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠军奖品是让你 选择自己喜欢的恐龙带回家
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.41,0:57:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要最大的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.95,0:57:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎 你要放哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.68,0:57:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.28,0:57:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问 有暴龙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.45,0:57:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.96,0:57:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,会攻击我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.66,0:57:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.26,0:57:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道会被吃掉？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.53,0:57:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊！会把你吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.53,0:57:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后会变成怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.47,0:57:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在肚子里变成化石然后吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.90,0:57:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说游戏结束
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.67,0:57:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.84,0:57:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,请放心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.74,0:57:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,接待员会将你们恢复原状的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.20,0:57:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.01,0:57:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说，还是小心点才好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.52,0:57:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里可以用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.05,0:57:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想和可爱的恐龙成为朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.79,0:57:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要大的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.26,0:57:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这个导游装置
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.93,0:57:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这附近好像有剑龙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.57,0:57:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.37,0:58:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是在这附近的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.11,0:58:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.07,0:58:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.87,0:58:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪里？- 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.48,0:58:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里呀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.02,0:58:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香，不要站在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.39,0:58:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.82,0:58:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑龙是草食动物
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.56,0:58:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸他也没关系唷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.43,0:58:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会咬人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.56,0:58:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！很乖的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.36,0:58:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙不动耶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.76,0:58:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是在睡觉呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.26,0:58:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.50,0:58:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样呀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.07,0:58:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑龙不适合赛龙耶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.51,0:58:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也对
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.18,0:58:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是找小只一点的比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.68,0:58:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们各自去找自己喜欢的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.65,0:58:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么办吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.22,0:58:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.29,0:58:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 如果有什么事情的话
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.79,0:58:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用这个导游装置联络
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.49,0:58:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.53,0:58:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，小夫 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.29,0:58:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要联络唷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.24,0:59:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有什么要出现耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.92,0:59:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是迅猛龙 很凶暴的肉食恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.72,0:59:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,长的不是很高大嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.65,0:59:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是头脑相当好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.29,0:59:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说，利用其中一只恐龙 去分散目标物的注意力后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.96,0:59:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的恐龙 再悄悄的从后方攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.00,0:59:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.44,0:59:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是三犄龙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.28,0:59:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然可爱但是跑不快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.28,0:59:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚子不饿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.29,0:59:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,先填饱肚子再找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.89,0:59:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.36,0:59:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快饱糖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.72,1:00:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有香肠口味，真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.26,1:00:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 只要吃一粒就觉得很饱了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.43,1:00:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有胖虎喜欢的暴龙就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.54,1:00:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？是小恐龙耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.31,1:00:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是只黏人的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.45,1:00:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！这不能吃的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！我讨厌瘦小的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.09,1:00:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢大恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.93,1:00:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，你看这个脚印
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.20,1:00:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！这可是大恐龙唷
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.40,1:00:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.93,1:00:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，在这里，在这！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.37,1:00:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.84,1:00:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是脕龙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.75,1:00:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是在找这么大的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.19,1:01:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才适合我呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.79,1:01:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大并不表示跑的快唷
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.59,1:01:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.09,1:01:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和蚂蚁，狗啦 比起来的话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.43,1:01:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会赢？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.53,1:01:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这样 但要怎么坐上去呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.77,1:01:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我要去找别的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.37,1:01:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好办法呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.47,1:01:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不想放弃呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.85,1:01:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.91,1:01:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫，等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.88,1:01:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.05,1:01:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来当我的助手
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.82,1:01:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.12,1:01:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 为何它的脖子 转向是那样的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.82,1:01:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的事呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.82,1:01:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的事呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.73,1:01:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你就不知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.46,1:01:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他只吃嫩叶的关系
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.20,1:01:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.37,1:01:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以赶快去帮我找绿叶嫩芽
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.00,1:01:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.17,1:01:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的，只顾到自己
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.01,1:01:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,多找一点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.24,1:02:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集好了就拿到脕龙嘴边
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.88,1:02:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当作诱饵吸引他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.92,1:02:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.39,1:02:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再跑快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.49,1:02:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想骑恐龙啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.10,1:02:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.37,1:02:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这样继续走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.24,1:02:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有点分寸吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.74,1:02:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道大家有没有 找到自己喜欢的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.98,1:02:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！好可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.85,1:02:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想吃是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.92,1:02:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.46,1:02:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能骑 我只好找其他的恐龙了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.93,1:02:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.50,1:02:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.93,1:02:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但吃太多是不好的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.14,1:03:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！有大恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.34,1:03:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会是坏恐龙？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.81,1:03:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种是鸭嘴龙 奔跑的速度相当快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.45,1:03:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但个性很温和
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.78,1:03:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以成为好朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.18,1:03:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，大家吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.63,1:03:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到喜欢的恐龙耶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.27,1:03:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们找到喜欢的恐龙了没
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.14,1:03:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦！翼龙如何呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.01,1:03:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错耶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.98,1:03:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是在空中飞的话 一定是最快的了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.58,1:03:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，去试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.09,1:03:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.69,1:03:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，海上有好多喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.46,1:03:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在抓鱼呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.16,1:03:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，要怎么坐上去呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.13,1:03:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之，先试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.27,1:04:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.64,1:04:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.84,1:04:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很过瘾耶
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.68,1:04:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我也来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.15,1:04:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我也来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.85,1:04:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，如果是翼龙的话 一定会拿第一名唷
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.83,1:04:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你够了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.29,1:04:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，继续加油
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.63,1:04:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你来让他追追看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.33,1:04:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会是第一名的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.07,1:04:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太难了 这是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.28,1:04:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.41,1:04:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫，让他停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.79,1:04:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.52,1:04:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.99,1:04:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己跑掉了 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.80,1:05:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是暴龙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.44,1:05:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这里来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.04,1:05:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.38,1:05:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太重了 飞不起来，放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.78,1:05:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想丢下我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.38,1:05:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！竹蜻蜓…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.32,1:05:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.56,1:05:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.64,1:05:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦！怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.01,1:05:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.34,1:05:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，变熟练了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.51,1:05:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,向左拉就会往左飞唷
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦，你看
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.55,1:06:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.62,1:06:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.66,1:06:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.40,1:06:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事情？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.93,1:06:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是机器坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.60,1:06:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.71,1:06:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.51,1:06:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我！暴龙不动了 到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.45,1:06:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是因为这样才得救了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.95,1:06:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的也是，不过…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.22,1:06:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香不知怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.32,1:06:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，联络看看
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.46,1:06:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸭嘴龙突然都倒下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.69,1:06:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事情了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.56,1:06:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那里也一样？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.83,1:06:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个梦幻乐园的设计真糟糕呀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.13,1:06:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去问问看
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.17,1:06:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家到中央办公室集合吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.41,1:06:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.61,1:07:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人都是由控制中心操纵的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.58,1:07:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么请赶快联络把他们修好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.92,1:07:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们刚刚 已经向通讯塔联络了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.79,1:07:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是一点回应都没有…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.89,1:07:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是中生代星球
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.49,1:07:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心，听到请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.10,1:07:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面骚动起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.34,1:07:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.61,1:07:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的机器人 乱七八糟地动了起来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.29,1:07:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,会变成怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.56,1:07:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是中央星球发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.13,1:07:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.76,1:07:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心，控制中心 听到请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.80,1:07:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家看那里
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.61,1:08:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,翼龙群攻过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.71,1:08:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快坐上去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.76,1:08:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.52,1:08:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲出这里
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.36,1:08:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不会追到宇宙空间来的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.76,1:08:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，加速了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.43,1:08:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像快撞到了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.73,1:08:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.57,1:08:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.22,1:08:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是中央星球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.85,1:08:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在好像是晚上
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.59,1:08:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看那里
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.06,1:08:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是火灾呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.80,1:09:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央星球果真发生事情了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.67,1:09:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.39,1:09:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头去查查看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.62,1:09:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我和小夫去有烟的地方看看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.50,1:09:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事的话 用导游装置联络吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.50,1:09:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了，小夫走吧 好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.47,1:09:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心一点
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.07,1:09:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心一点
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.64,1:09:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该是通讯塔吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.45,1:09:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，有人在吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.62,1:09:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕！被破坏得乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.69,1:09:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,火势变大了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.42,1:09:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赶快逃走的话很危险的 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.79,1:10:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人在吗 - 没有人的 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.80,1:10:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎 没人在的话 闯进来不好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.77,1:10:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要先走噜
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.67,1:10:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁在那里？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.34,1:10:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.38,1:10:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫！怎么了？小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.88,1:10:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪啊？小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.22,1:10:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么自己跑走了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.16,1:10:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.36,1:10:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶找过了 都没有人在
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.23,1:10:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,翼楼也没人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.97,1:10:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室连一只蟑螂也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.47,1:10:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎样了呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.10,1:10:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都躲到哪里去了呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.28,1:10:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.18,1:10:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.98,1:10:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫不见了？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.68,1:11:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，在那边等着
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.32,1:11:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的，让人操心的小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.16,1:11:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要突然停下来嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.76,1:11:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘，有人来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.53,1:11:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.96,1:11:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,从游乐园里出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.44,1:11:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.31,1:11:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是游乐园的设施
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.59,1:11:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在到处乱晃着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.16,1:11:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看天空
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.27,1:11:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好多妖魔鬼怪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.10,1:11:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,童话星球中的机器人来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.31,1:11:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.38,1:12:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了，快去胖虎那里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.69,1:12:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，这里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.82,1:12:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.69,1:12:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有小夫的消息？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.49,1:12:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 到底跑到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.09,1:12:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫非被妖怪拐走了？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.26,1:12:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,会吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.67,1:12:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.44,1:12:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.40,1:12:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这家伙，突然就消失了 真让人操心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.47,1:12:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.78,1:12:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.88,1:12:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现一个 绝对安全可以隐藏的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.71,1:12:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家赶快来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.75,1:12:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.29,1:12:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里好像没有妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.79,1:12:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此 躲到那里就不会被发现了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.92,1:12:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.24,1:13:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那，在那
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.91,1:13:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫，你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.58,1:13:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,找你找好久啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.35,1:13:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家到齐啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.12,1:13:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！发射
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.86,1:13:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.49,1:13:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要担心 只是让你们睡一下而已
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.76,1:13:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,0009号，做得很好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.00,1:13:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟其他人一样关到小屋去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.20,1:13:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来就算有几百人也是不够的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.20,1:13:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有800万只寄生虫在指令中心
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.51,1:13:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上天兵也要来征服新银河了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.48,1:13:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没水了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.65,1:13:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就喝完了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.62,1:13:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物也没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.66,1:13:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知有没有人会来救我们
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.16,1:13:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会有人来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.86,1:13:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是阿斯达
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.43,1:14:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个有钱的老爸就这么自傲
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.27,1:14:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真讨厌
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.07,1:14:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 下次碰到的话要狠狠的咬他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.77,1:14:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看！那不会是宇宙船吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.21,1:14:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.35,1:14:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.02,1:14:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.00,1:14:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫 居然把我们关在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.41,1:14:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我们出去 放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.81,1:14:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,啰嗦！安静一点
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.35,1:14:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙，你是小夫耶 居然靠到敌方去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.15,1:14:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么小夫？我是寄生虫0009号
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.72,1:14:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是寄居蟹耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.59,1:14:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄居蟹？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.72,1:15:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是寄生虫
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.93,1:15:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是宇宙里最高级存在者
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.09,1:15:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们等着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.26,1:15:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久以后你们也会被寄身的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.80,1:15:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说会被寄身的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.54,1:15:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是寄生生物吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.47,1:15:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄生生物？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.21,1:15:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己没有身体只有脑部
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.98,1:15:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以寄生到其他动物身上
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.45,1:15:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,任意操纵
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.72,1:15:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像操纵木偶一样
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.22,1:15:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 怎能被他们操纵
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.15,1:15:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是银河系的危机呀
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.42,1:15:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 赶紧用任意门联络警卫队
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.33,1:15:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.86,1:15:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦，振作一点
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.47,1:15:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,超空间被封锁住了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.07,1:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那四次元口袋也不能用啰？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.84,1:15:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.11,1:15:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！你…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.41,1:15:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，让你睡一下了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.75,1:15:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,警觉到的时候已经太晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.05,1:16:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围都是寄生人及妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.02,1:16:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是遇到车长
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.26,1:16:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会变成寄生人了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.62,1:16:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次似乎事态严重了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.86,1:16:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦，没办法逃出去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.86,1:16:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个好方法
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.10,1:16:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知道行不行得通
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.04,1:16:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.61,1:16:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是巡逻员
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.04,1:16:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有大火灾
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.81,1:16:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,火灾到处都有，不管它们
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.65,1:16:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正有人类的地方都要破坏掉
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.42,1:16:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要看好，别让他们逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.56,1:16:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.67,1:16:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.35,1:17:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了耶！车长
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.31,1:17:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为动用了所有的发烟筒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.92,1:17:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像火灾一样耶
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.22,1:17:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,连妖怪都被骗了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.19,1:17:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.54,1:17:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.34,1:17:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,600多人跟列车全部都被跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.88,1:17:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的身体要如何解决呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.05,1:17:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,0008号
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.55,1:17:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让警卫队知道 征服新银河计划的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.65,1:17:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.52,1:17:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬爱的天兵，请别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.46,1:17:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车的燃料都放掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.66,1:17:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.37,1:17:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以跑不远的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.90,1:18:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们一定会降落在 附近小行星群里的某处
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.01,1:18:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，赶快去找 一定要将那600人得到手
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.39,1:18:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.89,1:18:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间是颠倒的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.43,1:18:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候变成这样的？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.80,1:18:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全睡着了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.63,1:18:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的责任
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.14,1:18:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有燃料的关系
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.44,1:18:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个列车掉到惑星里了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.71,1:18:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是车长的责任
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.01,1:18:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说掉到某个星球了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.81,1:18:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是这样耶
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.05,1:18:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可以对寄生虫这样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.25,1:18:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 等你恢复成原来的小夫时 才能让你出来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.42,1:18:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.12,1:18:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.19,1:18:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓收集来了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.09,1:18:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他客人都没事 只是都睡着了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.76,1:19:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时不会醒来的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.20,1:19:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,去外面看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.60,1:19:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！怎么变这样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.97,1:19:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太严重了 乱七八糟的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.51,1:19:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好我们没怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.88,1:19:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为这些灰的关系
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.55,1:19:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座山是灰烬吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.28,1:19:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！将矿石挖走后 就剩这些灰烬了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.95,1:19:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 这里是“禁断星球”？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.62,1:19:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.96,1:19:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,车头若没摔坏的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.10,1:19:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法修吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.93,1:19:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太难了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.37,1:19:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那逃出来也没用了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.27,1:19:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样像这个星球一样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.94,1:19:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿死在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.01,1:19:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时可不必担心这些
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.78,1:19:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.11,1:19:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有岩石的地方 是这星球的城市
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.22,1:19:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有人住在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.52,1:20:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但仓库里应该藏有 食物及水等东西
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.43,1:20:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.96,1:20:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊！赶紧去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.93,1:20:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个，那个就是仓库
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.50,1:20:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.30,1:20:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都有耶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.64,1:20:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像是便利商店一样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.04,1:20:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,热腾腾的汉堡耶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.84,1:20:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,义大利面
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.04,1:20:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有各种甜点呀
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.11,1:20:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能有铜锣烧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.12,1:20:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.75,1:20:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量多吃一点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.72,1:20:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.72,1:20:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.36,1:20:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,车长
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.56,1:20:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.80,1:20:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公室里发现这个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.26,1:20:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该是地底1000公尺 的矿坑图吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.27,1:20:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.00,1:20:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这一个是运送 矿石出去的矿坑内车站吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.41,1:20:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜对了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.11,1:20:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那车头应该还留着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.88,1:20:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要再吃
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.22,1:21:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有车头
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.72,1:21:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是所有的出口都被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.82,1:21:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.56,1:21:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想有车头的话 就可以逃出去了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.69,1:21:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行的呀
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.06,1:21:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,矿坑里都塌陷了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.03,1:21:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去的话就出不来的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.50,1:21:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.57,1:21:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不要进去
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.44,1:21:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了，知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.17,1:21:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来讨论作战计划吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.21,1:21:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有车头啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.98,1:21:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,出口虽被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.32,1:21:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有好多洞口
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.85,1:21:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以想办法绕远路出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.06,1:21:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有地图 就不可能迷路啦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.89,1:21:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始探险
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.89,1:21:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是胖虎，我是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.70,1:21:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！竟然把小夫给忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.37,1:21:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄生虫肚子也会饿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.51,1:21:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是人类的身体嘛…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.11,1:21:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,带点东西给他吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.28,1:22:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有点不甘心
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.22,1:22:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,测到重力乱波了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.52,1:22:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是人类跟列车的讯号
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.09,1:22:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速追踪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.36,1:22:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你们的脚步
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.43,1:22:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有关系？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.70,1:22:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.14,1:22:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！这是上次洗澡时发现的幽浮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.67,1:22:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该只是个玩具吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.01,1:22:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是玩具吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.65,1:22:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像和寄生虫有关系呀
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.55,1:22:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿给巴姆看看
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.42,1:22:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫，食物拿来了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.86,1:22:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门噜 小心一点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.43,1:22:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫，怎么了？小夫…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.96,1:22:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.47,1:23:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我换身体可是轻而易举的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.14,1:23:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过这里就是第3区了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.58,1:23:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有车头的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.35,1:23:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！不行 都被落石挡住了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.98,1:23:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不行的话 只好退到7区了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.52,1:23:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有坍塌
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.76,1:23:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，还有其他的路
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.10,1:23:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是胖虎…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.10,1:23:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,用喷枪喷过后就掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.30,1:23:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷枪？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.43,1:23:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，放在浴室的喷枪
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.94,1:23:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦！有声音
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.24,1:23:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.81,1:23:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是寄生虫的原形呀
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.21,1:23:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是这个喷枪？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.75,1:23:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！就是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.42,1:23:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真空肥皂
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.22,1:23:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是全身被肥皂包围起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.66,1:23:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以变硬了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.83,1:23:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴姆先生…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.30,1:23:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请过来一下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.70,1:23:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.30,1:24:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.54,1:24:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.64,1:24:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，振作点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.01,1:24:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我攻击巴姆？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.18,1:24:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你被寄生虫寄生了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.42,1:24:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也因此找出弱点了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.26,1:24:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫恢复了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.46,1:24:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.59,1:24:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全都听哆啦A梦说了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.23,1:24:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对大家做了不该做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.56,1:24:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放在心上，都是寄生虫害的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.13,1:24:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样同伴们都到齐了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.57,1:24:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.90,1:24:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊！胖虎呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.64,1:24:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.51,1:24:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迷路 搞不清楚方向了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.81,1:24:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有声音
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.02,1:25:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁来救我们的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.16,1:25:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来救我的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.76,1:25:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.70,1:25:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么嘛！我们都迷了路
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.14,1:25:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真失望
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.27,1:25:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从宇宙掉到这个洞里来了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.61,1:25:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了进来找车头的 但迷路了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.11,1:25:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,车头？在那边有一辆啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.45,1:25:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.28,1:25:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是车头耶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.72,1:25:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有车头的话 就能逃出禁断星球了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.39,1:25:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有救了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.13,1:25:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，没有出口要怎样搬出去呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.36,1:25:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！真的是 不能和命运之神作战呀
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.94,1:25:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少也要记得把食物带进来的呀
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.11,1:25:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.81,1:26:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎…你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.95,1:26:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车里都找遍了 但没看到人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.65,1:26:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上也找过了 找不到
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.69,1:26:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里了呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.99,1:26:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现胖虎的脚印了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.90,1:26:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕，跑到矿坑里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.33,1:26:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是的 - 不行！不能进去呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.30,1:26:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不能坐视不管呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.64,1:26:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胖虎 - 胖虎…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.91,1:26:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险！坍塌了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.09,1:26:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.79,1:26:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胖虎 - 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.16,1:26:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！只好放弃了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.23,1:26:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，好可怜呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.27,1:26:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然很粗暴，但也很体贴啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.83,1:26:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也见不到他了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.91,1:27:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍法 穿墙术
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.02,1:27:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.82,1:27:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害呀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.69,1:27:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有救了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.85,1:27:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.10,1:27:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,水和食物都装上了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.63,1:27:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有武器就更好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.10,1:27:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然没有武器
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.94,1:27:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是只要一天 就可能到警卫队的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.71,1:27:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不用担心
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.72,1:27:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,接收到强烈的重力波
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.16,1:27:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达也有列车影子的反应
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.29,1:27:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人就在前面了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.49,1:27:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全力转舵 - 收到！全力转舵
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.96,1:27:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次一定要全抓起来 让你瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.67,1:27:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的表现了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.54,1:28:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现列车了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.54,1:28:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,终究还是出现了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.34,1:28:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,比想像中还要早嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.74,1:28:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然很不甘心
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.54,1:28:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这种速度马上就会被追上的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.81,1:28:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有武器
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.21,1:28:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以能逃多远就逃多远
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.75,1:28:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入星屑的密集区吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.55,1:28:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则无法躲避那么大的宇宙船啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.82,1:28:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意见不错
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.59,1:28:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车驾驶由我负责
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.66,1:28:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.66,1:28:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人都聚集了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.49,1:28:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,减速，收帆
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.56,1:28:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用减速
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.23,1:28:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在进入密集区前让它们无法航行
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.47,1:28:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击开始
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.31,1:28:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要攻击列车
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.58,1:28:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要人类的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.42,1:28:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车失控了 即将降落到那个星球上
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.34,1:29:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人类都出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.44,1:29:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的身体是很珍贵的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.48,1:29:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会做坏的用途的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.15,1:29:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么安静？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.02,1:29:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有任何反应
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.00,1:29:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住！寄生虫们
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.20,1:29:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在等我们嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.24,1:29:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看枪
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.38,1:29:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯达
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.92,1:29:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯达，有没有关系？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.62,1:29:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦？这是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.46,1:29:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.12,1:30:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯达
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.86,1:30:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真爽快呀
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.76,1:30:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.36,1:30:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻退
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.50,1:30:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个金黄色的是老大
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.73,1:30:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要被逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.94,1:30:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎能输给人类
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.91,1:30:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到海贼船里了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.18,1:30:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到海贼船里了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.28,1:30:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们瞧瞧寄生天兵的威力
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.88,1:30:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄生到机器人体内了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.79,1:30:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄生虫虽无法像生物般的活动
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.96,1:30:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是能操作电脑
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.86,1:30:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起喷水
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.87,1:30:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！不行呀
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.74,1:30:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,肥皂液无法喷到它
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.21,1:30:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先找地方躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.58,1:30:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人类
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.51,1:30:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,自认为逃得过吗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.72,1:31:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一个
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.76,1:31:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓到了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.59,1:31:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 寄生到你身上看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.66,1:31:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.46,1:31:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗憾啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.56,1:31:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄，好厉害呀
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.97,1:31:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是大雄厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.24,1:31:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是射击神枪手耶
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.57,1:31:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.54,1:31:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！寄生虫被逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.86,1:32:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉增加各位的麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.66,1:32:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也谢谢帮我们解决问题
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.10,1:32:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些寄生虫不可能再来侵犯了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.57,1:32:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了能早日重建这个乐园
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.14,1:32:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会加油的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.58,1:32:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请加油
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.48,1:32:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会尽力协助的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.42,1:32:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢各位
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.62,1:32:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,车长，请将他们安全送回
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.26,1:32:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.33,1:32:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路小心，再见
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.21,1:33:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.98,1:33:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽是大冒险 但是很有趣耶
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.45,1:33:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的人也恢复了原状 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.09,1:33:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯达的爸爸 也答应好要重建乐园
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.73,1:33:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.83,1:33:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有责任的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.40,1:33:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的责任
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.00,1:33:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是寄生虫的责任
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.84,1:33:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊！是寄居蟹的错
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.87,1:33:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎，是寄生虫啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.94,1:33:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.81,1:33:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经取笑你们是古代人
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.81,1:33:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.78,1:33:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该学学各位的勇气
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.92,1:33:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 他们是从20世纪星球来的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.15,1:33:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的祖先唷
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.96,1:33:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是祖父的祖父的 祖父的祖父…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.63,1:33:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这种祖父呀
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.30,1:34:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就要着陆在 20世纪太阳系第3惑星
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.30,1:34:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.04,1:34:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要再来喔
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.57,1:34:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.91,1:34:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后就到站的是 地球 地球
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.88,1:34:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要忘记您随身的行李
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.69,1:34:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保重
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.06,1:34:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在海边拾到的这小贝壳 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.14,1:34:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 为什么会变成螺旋的形状 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.70,1:34:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 教晓我的 是你呀 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.85,1:35:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那是在夜空中闪烁的银河 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.19,1:35:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 贝壳听到那声音 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.08,1:35:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 被银河迷住了 变成螺旋的形状 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.87,1:35:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的耳朵 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.60,1:35:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 还有贝壳 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.92,1:35:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也想听到你的声音 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.95,1:35:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可是你却比星星还要遥远 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.95,1:36:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我心中感到奇怪 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.96,1:36:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当我静静想起你的时候 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.40,1:36:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 心情就如银河般 起伏不定 ∮
